17:Ta24,[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Service","name":"Soil remediation services in Canada","serviceType":"soil remediation services","provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Canada Spill Cleanup & Remediation","telephone":"+1888XXXXXXX","url":"https://spillresponsecrew.com/"},"areaServed":"Canada (National)","url":"https://spillresponsecrew.com/soil-remediation-services","description":"We coordinate sampling, excavation, and off-site disposal with your environmental consultant. National soil remediation services routing covers every province—share your postal code so we assign the nearest metro crew. Canadian winters, vandalism, and vehicle strikes all show up on our dispatch board—tell us which scenario you are in. When soil remediation services spikes after holidays, early calls secure on-site slots before supplier queues grow. Related searches such as contaminated soil cleanup are handled on the same line. Call 1-888-XXX-XXXX with the address, photos of the break, and whether the spill zone is exposed to weather."},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://spillresponsecrew.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Services","item":"https://spillresponsecrew.com/services"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Soil remediation services Canada","item":"https://spillresponsecrew.com/soil-remediation-services"}]},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is soil remediation services in Canada priced per spill or per spill zone?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Price depends on spill type, size, access, and whether on-site is needed tonight. Call 1-888-XXX-XXXX with photos for a range before we book."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How soon can you do soil remediation services in Canada?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Exposed spill zones and security risks move you up the q